---
args: {"scenes": "SceneInformation[]", "evidence": "EvidenceItem[]"}
returns: "RevealBoundary[]"
---
For every meaningful visual clue or speaker identity call distinguishObservationFromReveal(scene, evidence). Track when the fact is observable separately from when its identity or narrative meaning is disclosed. Preserve the audience's intended uncertainty and alternative interpretations. A description may name the visible object while withholding its future explanation.
